    <p class="note">${real >= 1.005 ? `Your ${usd0(val)} beat inflation by <b style="color:var(--up)">${usd0(val - need)}</b>. In buying power, your money grew <b>${mult(real)}</b>.` : real > 0.995 ? `Your ${usd0(val)} just about kept up with inflation.` : `Your ${usd0(val)} didn't keep up with inflation. It buys what <b style="color:var(--down)">${usd0(1e6 * real)}</b> bought in ${when}, a <b>${Math.round((1 - real) * 100)}%</b> loss of buying power.`}</p>
